{"q":"539","t":"Minimum Time Difference","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"Given a list of 24-hour clock time points in <strong>&quot;HH:MM&quot;</strong> format, return <em>the minimum <b>minutes</b> difference between any two time-points in the list</em>.\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> timePoints = [\"23:59\",\"00:00\"]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> timePoints = [\"00:00\",\"23:59\",\"00:00\"]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 0\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>2 &lt;= timePoints.length &lt;= 2 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>timePoints[i]</code> is in the format <strong>&quot;HH:MM&quot;</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"findMinDifference\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"timePoints\",\r\n      \"type\": \"list<string>\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}],"s":[{"t":"Minimum Cost to Set Cooking Time","s":"minimum-cost-to-set-cooking-time","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Visa","visa"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Palantir","palantir"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Capital One","capital-one"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[],"m":[["Google","google",16],["Meta","facebook",11],["Microsoft","microsoft",6],["Visa","visa",6],["Amazon","amazon",4],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",4],["Capital One","capital-one",4],["Palantir","palantir",2]]}}